   "source": [
    "# Comparing the segmentation results to the data\n",
    "* The \"Segment\" function computes the segmentation for each of the processed images; we can test the sensitivity for preprocessing by altering the \"preproc_gray\" vector\n",
    "* The regionprops table can be broadcasted without an issue. I'm having it take in the orientation, axis lengths, areas, etc.\n",
    "* In the paper"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "2917ba1b-5ccc-4023-92c1-f74ffa48b75b",
